{
  "id": "T001",
  "title": "My Mom",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-04-22",
  "synopsis": "A story by a young Chinese boy who adores his mom.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/60001/36d94374b3bad9dab966fe0e445a31663208c1e6.mp3?1587289665",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我的妈妈\n\n    我的妈妈是中国人，今年48岁了，她很漂亮，人也很好。她是一个汉语老师，有很多外国学生。她的学生都喜欢她。他们常常来我家，他们爱吃妈妈做的中国菜，也喜欢看妈妈写中国字，她的字非常漂亮。\n    妈妈看见学生们高兴，她也很高兴。我觉得妈妈很棒，我爱我妈妈！",
    "traditional": "我的媽媽\n\n    我的媽媽是中國人，今年48歲了，她很漂亮，人也很好。她是一個漢語老師，有很多外國學生。她的學生都喜歡她。他們常常來我家，他們愛吃媽媽做的中國菜，也喜歡看媽媽寫中國字，她的字非常漂亮。\n    媽媽看見學生們高興，她也很高興。我覺得媽媽很棒，我愛我媽媽！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "My Mom"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "我的妈妈是中国人，今年48岁了，她很漂亮，人也很好。",
      "traditional": "我的媽媽是中國人，今年48歲了，她很漂亮，人也很好。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de mā ma shì zhōng guó rén jīn nián 3 suì le tā hěn piào liang rén yě hěn hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "她是一个汉语老师，有很多外国学生。",
      "traditional": "她是一個漢語老師，有很多外國學生。",
      "pinyin": "tā shì yí ge hàn yǔ lǎo shī yǒu hěn duō wài guó xué sheng",
      "english": "My mom is Chinese, and will be 48 this year. She is beautiful, and a very nice person."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "她的学生都喜欢她。",
      "traditional": "她的學生都喜歡她。",
      "pinyin": "tā de xué sheng dōu xǐ huan tā",
      "english": "She is a Chinese teacher, and has many foreign students."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "他们常常来我家，",
      "traditional": "他們常常來我家，",
      "pinyin": "tā men cháng cháng lái wǒ jiā",
      "english": "All her students like her."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "他们爱吃妈妈做的中国菜，也喜欢看妈妈写中国字，",
      "traditional": "他們愛吃媽媽做的中國菜，也喜歡看媽媽寫中國字，",
      "pinyin": "tā men ài chī mā ma zuò de zhōng guó cài yě xǐ huan kàn mā ma xiě zhōng guó zì",
      "english": "They often come to our house."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "她的字非常漂亮。",
      "traditional": "她的字非常漂亮。",
      "pinyin": "tā de zì fēi cháng piào liang",
      "english": "They love to eat Chinese dishes cooked by my mom, and also like to watch her write Chinese characters."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Her characters are extremely beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "妈妈看见学生们高兴，她也很高兴。",
      "traditional": "媽媽看見學生們高興，她也很高興。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma kàn jiàn xué sheng men gāo xìng tā yě hěn gāo xìng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "我觉得妈妈很棒，我爱我妈妈！",
      "traditional": "我覺得媽媽很棒，我愛我媽媽！",
      "pinyin": "wǒ jué de mā ma hěn bàng wǒ ài wǒ mā ma",
      "english": "Seeing her students happy makes my mom happy too."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I think my mom is great, I love my mom!"
    }
  ],
